# Global Skill Manager

Before working on a user request in this project, check whether the request matches an existing global skill in:

`C:\Users\Donald\.gemini\config\plugins\my-global-skills\skills\`

Also consult the manager index when the task is broad, strategic, repetitive, or looks like a known workflow:

`C:\Users\Donald\.gemini\config\plugins\my-global-skills\rules\auto-skill-manager.md`

Use the matching `SKILL.md` as guidance before acting when it fits the user's request.

Do not create a new global skill automatically for every task. Create or update a skill only when the user asks for it, or when a reusable workflow has clearly emerged and the user approves.

When editing code, still follow the current project's architecture, tests, safety rules, and Git hygiene.
